  "design_section": "7.10",
  "design_notes": [
    "The section is \"Structural material (whole vehicle)\": both multipliers are modifiers with scope vehicle and the Integ. days column is game.integ_days (stainless steel is −5). The baseline row is stored as printed (1.00×, 1.0×, +0).",
    "The cost multiplier has no stated base: tanks have no cost in 7.9 (open question 11 in data/README.md). It is stored on the vehicle cost until the design names the base.",
    "Carbon composite: \"cryogenic leak risk with LH₂ unless tested\" names no test. static_fire is chosen because section 6.6 says it \"reveals plumbing leaks\"; the rule is limited to LH2_LOX builds. Confirm the test with the design owner.",
    "The failure model (8.4) gives \"light material\" as a cause of structural failure without saying which materials count as light, so no material lists structural_failure.",
    "MG-03 Weld Inspector runs \"during structural material integration\", so every material enables it, including carbon composite, which the design does not exclude. Its fact is not in the fact bank.",
    "Stainless steel \"+reuse life\" has no number: flag extended_reuse_life.",
    "The facts in the Twin / fact column (Super Lightweight Tank 1998, X-33 1999, Atlas balloon tanks) have no ID in the fact bank of 12.4; they are kept in the twin text.",
    "No contracts list: the design restricts no material. No model path: a material is a surface finish, not a model of its own."
  ],
